        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: വിയോജിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിയോജിക്കുക — viyōjikkuka — \"to disagree\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഞാൻ നിങ്ങളോട് വിയോജിക്കുന്നു. ñān niṅṅaḷōṭŭ viyōjikkunnu. I disagree with you."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: വിയോജിച്ചു, viyōjiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person takes -ഓട്: അവനോട് വിയോജിക്കുക (viyōjikkuka). Its opposite is യോജിക്കുക, to agree."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിയോജിക്കുക (viyōjikkuka) is built from Sanskrit viyojana, \"detaching, separation\" (Monier-Williams): the prefix vi-, \"apart\", on the root yuj, \"to join\", the root of യോജിക്കുക. To disagree is to come apart."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
