          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തർക്കം — tarkkaṁ — \"a dispute; a quarrel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വീടിന്റെ വിലയെക്കുറിച്ച് അവർ തമ്മിൽ തർക്കം ഉണ്ടായി. vīṭinṟe vilayekkuṟiccŭ avar tammil tarkkaṁ uṇṭāyi. There was a dispute between them about the price of the house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The verb തർക്കിക്കുക, to argue, is the same word."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തർക്കം (tarkkaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit tarka, \"inquiry, conjecture, reasoning\" (CDIAL 5714). In Malayalam the reasoning became the quarrel it can lead to."
            }
          ]
        },
